{"head_html": "<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\"/>\n<title>Intelligence Report - Social Media Monitoring</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        primary: '#007f8c',\n                        secondary: '#00b3c1',\n                        accent: '#00d4e6',\n                        dark: '#0a1929',\n                        light: '#f8fafc'\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n<style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f8fafc;\n            color: #0a1929;\n        }\n        .sentiment-negative { border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; }\n        .sentiment-neutral { border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; }\n        .sentiment-positive { border-left: 4px solid #10b981; }\n        .card-shadow {\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n        }\n        .platform-twitter { background-color: #1da1f2; }\n        .platform-instagram { background-color: #e1306c; }\n        .platform-facebook { background-color: #1877f2; }\n        .platform-youtube { background-color: #ff0000; }\n        .platform-whatsapp { background-color: #25d366; }\n        .chart-bar {\n            transition: height 0.5s ease;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>", "tagged_body_html": "<body class=\"bg-light\">\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n<!-- Header -->\n<header class=\"mb-10 text-center\">\n<h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-2\">Social Media Intelligence Report</h1>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Public Safety Monitoring Dashboard</p>\n<div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-primary rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-shield-alt text-white text-2xl\"></i>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-gray-500\">\n<p data-slot=\"s1\">Report Period: June 1-30, 2023 | Generated: October 15, 2023</p>\n</div>\n</header>\n<!-- Summary Stats -->\n<section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8\">\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary\" data-slot=\"s2\">1,284</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Total Mentions</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary\" data-slot=\"s3\">84%</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Positive Sentiment</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary\" data-slot=\"s4\">247</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Engagement Events</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-primary\" data-slot=\"s5\">12</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Active Platforms</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Main Content Grid -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8\">\n<!-- Sentiment Analysis -->\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-chart-line mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Sentiment Analysis\n                </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Negative</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s6\">12%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5\">\n<div class=\"bg-red-500 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 12%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Neutral</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s7\">28%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5\">\n<div class=\"bg-yellow-500 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 28%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex justify-between mb-1\">\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Positive</span>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s8\">60%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5\">\n<div class=\"bg-green-500 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 60%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Platform Distribution -->\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-globe mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Platform Distribution\n                </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Twitter/X</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-slot=\"s9\">32%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-pink-500 mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Instagram</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-slot=\"s10\">24%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">Facebook</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-slot=\"s11\">18%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500 mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">YouTube</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-slot=\"s12\">15%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500 mr-2\"></div>\n<span class=\"text-sm\">WhatsApp</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" data-slot=\"s13\">11%</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Engagement Metrics -->\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-fire mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Engagement Metrics\n                </h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-dark\" data-slot=\"s14\">1,042</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Likes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-dark\" data-slot=\"s15\">156</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Comments</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-dark\" data-slot=\"s16\">89</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Shares</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-dark\" data-slot=\"s17\">324</div>\n<div class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">Views</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Top Posts -->\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-newspaper mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Top Posts\n                </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">@CommunityWatch</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Twitter/X</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mt-1 text-sm\" data-slot=\"s18\">Safety concerns reported at downtown intersection. Emergency response underway.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-xs bg-green-100 text-green-800 px-2 py-1 rounded\">Positive</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-2\">2 hours ago</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-l-4 border-yellow-500 pl-4 py-2\">\n<div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">@CityPolice</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Instagram</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mt-1 text-sm\">Community safety initiative launched with local businesses.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center\">\n<span class=\"text-xs bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 px-2 py-1 rounded\">Neutral</span>\n<span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 ml-2\">5 hours ago</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Additional Sections -->\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-hashtag mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Trending Topics &amp; Keywords\n            </h2>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4\">\n<span class=\"bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">#SafetyFirst</span>\n<span class=\"bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">#CommunityAlert</span>\n<span class=\"bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">#PublicSecurity</span>\n<span class=\"bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">#EmergencyResponse</span>\n<span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-800 text-xs font-medium px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\">#CrimePrevention</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\" data-slot=\"s19\">Monitoring indicates increased activity around community safety initiatives and emergency response protocols.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow mb-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Emerging Trends\n            </h2>\n<div class=\"h-64 flex items-end justify-between space-x-2\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 1</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 40%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s20\">40%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 2</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 65%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s21\">65%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 3</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 80%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s22\">80%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 4</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 95%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s23\">95%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 5</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 75%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s24\">75%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center w-1/6\">\n<div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 mb-1\">Week 6</div>\n<div class=\"w-full bg-green-500 chart-bar\" style=\"height: 55%\"></div>\n<div class=\"text-xs mt-1\" data-slot=\"s25\">55%</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg card-shadow\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-dark mb-4 flex items-center\">\n<i class=\"fas fa-user-shield mr-2 text-primary\"></i> Intelligence Summary\n            </h2>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\" data-slot=\"s26\">Overall sentiment remains positive with increased engagement around community safety topics. No immediate threats identified.</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-3\" data-slot=\"s27\">Key actors include local law enforcement accounts, community organizations, and civic groups actively participating in safety discussions.</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700\" data-slot=\"s28\">Recommendation: Continue monitoring for potential escalation indicators in community safety discourse.</p>\n</section>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 text-center text-sm text-gray-500\">\n<p>Confidential Intelligence Report \u2022 For Internal Use Only</p>\n<p class=\"mt-2\">\u00a9 2023 Public Safety Intelligence Division</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>", "slots": [{"slot_id": "s1", "slot_type": "freetext", "sample_text": "Report Period: June 1-30, 2023 | Generated: October 15, 2023", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": null, "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s2", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "1,284", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "total_posts", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s3", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "84%", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.positive", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s4", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "247", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.negative", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s5", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "12", "context_label": "", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.neutral", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s6", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "12%", "context_label": "Negative", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.negative", "status": "clean"}, {"slot_id": "s7", "slot_type": "stat_number", "sample_text": "28%", "context_label": "Neutral", "chips": [], "meaning_text": "", "maps_to": "sentiment_counts.neutral",